    skos:editorialNote "Explanatory notes as updated by UNSD on 19 August 2026 (pre-edited version)."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/isic-rev5/4763> xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/isic-rev5/4763/note/exclusionNote> .
<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/isic-rev5/4763/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This class excludes:\n- retail sale of video consoles and video games on a physical medium, see 4740\n- second-hand retail sale of games and toys, see 4774\n- distribution of video games via streaming and downloading by their publishers, see 5821\n- distribution of audio via streaming and downloading by their publishers, see 5920\n- edition/publishing of games, board games, see 5819\n- content distribution (sharing) platforms for video games, see 6039"@en ;
    dct:source <https://unstats.un.org/unsd/classifications/Econ/Download/ISIC5_Exp_Notes_19_Aug_2026.xlsx> ;
    skos:editorialNote "Explanatory notes as updated by UNSD on 19 August 2026 (pre-edited version)."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/isic-rev5/4769> xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/isic-rev5/4769/note/coreContentNote> .
<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/isic-rev5/4769/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This class includes retail sale of cultural and recreational goods not elsewhere classified:\n- retail sale of recorded media\n- retail sale of musical instruments, scores and related accessories, e.g. strings, music stands, metronomes\n- retail sale of philately, numismatics and collectors’ items such as stamps and coins\n- activities of commercial art galleries"@en ;
    dct:source <https://unstats.un.org/unsd/classifications/Econ/Download/ISIC5_Exp_Notes_19_Aug_2026.xlsx> ;
    skos:editorialNote "Explanatory notes as updated by UNSD on 19 August 2026 (pre-edited version)."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/isic-rev5/4769> xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/isic-rev5/4769/note/additionalContentNote> .
<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/isic-rev5/4769/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This class also includes also:\n- retail sale of art supplies, including beads, clay, canvasses, oil and water colours etc."@en ;
