    skos:editorialNote "Explanatory notes as updated by UNSD on 19 August 2026 (pre-edited version)."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/isic-rev5/4769> xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/isic-rev5/4769/note/exclusionNote> .
