<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/isic-rev5/4771/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This class excludes:\n- retail sale of textiles, see 4751\n- retail sale of special footwear for sports e.g. football shoes, ice skates, ski boots, etc., see 4762"@en ;
